### Variables
@proxy = https://localhost:7257
@holder = {{proxy}}/holder

### 1. What DID does this wallet hold?
GET {{holder}}/wallet/did

### 2. List currently held credentials
GET {{holder}}/wallet/credentials

### 3. Redeem a credential offer end-to-end
# Get an offerUri by POSTing to {{proxy}}/issuer/credential-offer first.
@offerUri = openid-credential-offer://?credential_offer=REPLACE-ME

POST {{holder}}/wallet/redeem-offer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "offerUri": "{{offerUri}}"
}

### Diagnostics
GET {{holder}}/info
GET {{holder}}/health
